diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 4479b53..6a17ecf 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -15,3 +15,13 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Privacy audit
+
+The account forms collect only username and password and explain the destination and purpose before submission. Requests omit cookies and referrers, disable fetch caching and redirects, and expose only generic errors. Passwords are cleared after each completed request; credentials and returned tokens are not persisted by the forms. Password managers remain available through explicit autocomplete hints.
+
+The shared layout has no remote analytics, advertising, or font loads. It uses local font fallbacks and a UTF-8 declaration plus a no-referrer meta policy. Middleware also applies Referrer-Policy and disables camera, microphone, and geolocation; account documents use Cache-Control: no-store. Reading-list sessions are initialized by saving an article rather than on every visit.
+
+The public privacy notice describes the remaining data flows. Production follow-up requires an audit of the external authentication service's storage, retention, logging, and deletion behavior; that service is outside this repository. External article images and the sample article cookie demonstrations still exist. This change does not claim site-wide cookie elimination or verified legal compliance.
+
+Validation: run `pnpm build` without starting the application. No live credentials are needed for this audit.
